Carlsberg from £3.99 & Madri from £4.99
Pay less, get more
There aren’t very many ways to make a crisp, cold pint taste even better, but we’ve just found one: when it costs less than a fiver!
At The Jolly Fenman, you can get your hands on a pint of Carlsberg for just £3.99, and Madri for just £4.99. With absolutely no catch. This isn’t happy hour – we’re talking all day, every day of the week. So whether you’re hitting the pub for midweek work drinks, or you’re OUT out on a Friday, you’ll be draining your glass, not your bank balance.
Oh, and if you’re watching the game, good news! Your pint will cost even less, with our 10% match day discount. If that&#39;s not enough of a reason to get a round in, we don&#39;t know what is.
New menu, same old savings!
We just cranked up the flavour dial and turned the price dial down. Way down. With deals all week long, you&#39;ll never have to settle for a supermarket meal deal ever again.
View our deals
Our new menu is here!
It&#39;s bigger than ever, it&#39;s beefier than ever and it&#39;s more banging than ever before. New sauces, new flavours, new dishes, new DEALS! And it&#39;s all waiting for you at The Jolly Fenman right now. There is no time to waste.
Check it out
