​ Welcome to The Station House &mdash; a warm and welcoming pub nestled on Churchfield Road in the heart of Acton. Step inside and you'll find a place full of character, where locals and friends gather for great drinks, hearty food, and good company. With comfy seating, a cozy atmosphere, and friendly faces all around, it's the kind of place where you instantly feel at home.
Whether you're popping in for a pint after work, catching up with friends over burgers, or joining us for one of our signature magic nights, The Station House is where good times happen. Come as you are &mdash; you'll always be greeted with a smile and a warm welcome.
