Two Mains for £20 | Winning Post
☀️ Make the most of the sunshine at the Winning Post! ☀️
Open Today: 6:30am - 11:00pm
Two mains. One tidy £20.&#160;
Whether it&#39;s a midweek catch-up with your mates, a long-overdue lunch date or simply a night off from the kitchen, your local is calling.&#160;
Join us Monday to Friday for two mains for £20, with tasty pub favourites like Chargrilled Gammon Steak, Chargrilled Hunter’s Chicken and Katsu Chicken Curry on the menu. Add a welcoming atmosphere, a good natter and someone else doing the washing up, and you&#39;ve got all the ingredients for a rather lovely time. Go on, make a meal of it.
Book a table
How to claim
Fancy two mains for £20? Sign up to our email club, and we&#39;ll send your special offer code straight to your inbox, ready for your next pub outing. Think tasty plates of Steak & Ale Pie, Hand-battered Cod and Wholetail Scampi, all the more tempting with a mate across the table.&#160;
And that&#39;s not all. You&#39;ll also be first in the know about pub news, tempting offers and other tasty goings-on. Not to blow our own trumpet, but that&#39;s a pretty good email to receive.
